    "lyrics": {
      "text": "We praise thee, the Me-di-a-tress for the sal-va-tion of our race, O Vir-gin The-o-to-kos; for in the flesh tak-en from thee, thy Son and our God hath deigned to en-dure the pas-sion through the Cross, and hath re-deemed us from cor-rup-tion, since He is the Friend of man.____"
